# Input

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
let count:number=$state(1)
const label=$derived(`count: ${count}`)
</script>

<p>{count}ms: <strong>{label}</strong> <em>now</em>!</p>
<p>+{count}<span>ms</span><span>!</span></p>
<p>Elapsed: <strong aria-label="elapsed time in milliseconds">{count}ms</strong> <em>{label}</em>!</p>
<pre>  {label}
    {count}  ms</pre>
<textarea>  {label}
    {count}  ms</textarea>

<style>
p strong::before{content:"  =  "}
</style>

```


# Formatted

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
let count: number = $state(1);
const label = $derived(`count: ${count}`);
</script>

<p>{count}ms: <strong>{label}</strong> <em>now</em>!</p>
<p>+{count}<span>ms</span><span>!</span></p>
<p>
	Elapsed: <strong aria-label="elapsed time in milliseconds">{count}ms</strong>
	<em>{label}</em>!
</p>
<pre>  {label}
    {count}  ms</pre>
<textarea>  {label}
    {count}  ms</textarea>

<style>
p strong::before {
	content: "  =  ";
}
</style>

```



## Unimplemented nodes/tokens

"  {label}\n    {count}  ms" => 318..343
"  {label}\n    {count}  ms" => 360..385
